/* Detailed settings guidance */
"The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." = "应用列表会写入磁盘，因此 Android 尚未启动完成时也能立即显示。";
"Names and icons come from Android's own launcher, which keeps the version it draws. Re-fetching throws away DroidDeck's copies and asks again." = "名称和图标来自 Android 自带的启动器。重新获取会删除 DroidDeck 保存的副本并再次请求。";
"Noto Sans CJK, the font Android uses for these languages. Games and apps that draw their own text (Unity, Flutter, cocos2d-x) show empty boxes for these characters without it. Takes effect the next time an app opens." = "Noto Sans CJK 是 Android 用于中日韩文字的字体。Unity、Flutter、cocos2d-x 等自行绘制文字的游戏和应用若未安装该字体，会显示空方框。下次打开应用时生效。";
"Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way." = "为 Android 添加声音设备。连接声音设备时 QEMU 无法保存虚拟机状态，因此每次都必须冷启动；开启或关闭此项后也都需要冷启动一次。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "画面面板会在虚拟机启动时创建，因此修改后需要冷启动；下一次保存会替换旧尺寸的虚拟机状态，再改回去也需要重新冷启动。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数，分辨率越高速度越慢。Android 的显示密度不会随面板改变，所以更大的尺寸会显示更多内容，而不是把内容放大。";
"Touch is always on. The keyboard and the rotate control are in the pill at the bottom of the guest's screen; a gamepad and a pointer are not wired through yet." = "触控始终开启。键盘和旋转按钮位于 Android 画面底部的控制条中；游戏手柄和鼠标指针暂未接入。";
"Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." = "Android 通过 QEMU 自带网络中的虚拟网卡访问互联网。手机局域网中的其他设备看不到 Android，Android 也看不到它们。";
"DroidDeck needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so DroidDeck tests both rather than assuming." = "DroidDeck 需要一块可先写入再执行的内存，而 iOS 要求应用附加调试器后才允许。可通过响应陷阱请求的调试器，或内核允许调试进程使用的 MAP_JIT 映射获得；任意一种即可。具体可用方式取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 DroidDeck 会同时检测。";
"Off by default. DroidDeck detaches StikDebug as soon as the JIT region is held, because a debugger that iOS has suspended stops the whole app the next time it is needed. Turn this on only to collect StikDebug's own logs." = "默认关闭。DroidDeck 获取 JIT 内存后会立即断开 StikDebug，因为被 iOS 挂起的调试器在下次响应时会让整个应用停住。仅在需要收集 StikDebug 自身日志时开启。";
"APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. Split sets — a base APK plus its config pieces — must be picked together; installing the base alone fails on missing native libraries." = "可通过应用库中的“+”按钮或“文件”页面安装 APK。拆分安装包（基础 APK 与配置组件）必须一起选择；只安装基础 APK 会因缺少原生库而失败。";
"DroidDeck restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install." = "DroidDeck 会恢复已保存的虚拟机而不是重新启动，因此只需数秒而不是数分钟。保存时画面会短暂冻结；关闭后任何内容都不会自动保存，包括安装应用之后。";
"Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own." = "首次下载会额外增加约 2 GB。该快照使用软件渲染器创建，因此 GPU 模式不会使用它；GPU 模式会冷启动一次并保存自己的状态。";
"When a new Android image or snapshot is published, DroidDeck asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded." = "发布新的 Android 镜像或快照时，DroidDeck 会询问一次是否下载；在尚未下载 Android 前不会询问。";
"System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own screen stays dark either way — it is a picture of another phone. Holiday decorations appear from December to early January." = "“跟随系统”会随手机在浅色与深色模式间切换。Android 自身画面无论哪种模式都会保持原有颜色。节日装饰会在 12 月至次年 1 月初显示。";
"Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: library reports, device checks and run logs." = "在 Android 转译层界面中显示库报告、设备检查和运行日志等技术信息。";
"DroidDeck runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows DroidDeck's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from." = "DroidDeck 会在 iPhone 上的完整 Android 系统中运行未经修改的 APK。控制台会显示 DroidDeck 实时日志、Android 串行输出和 QEMU 输出，这三类信息用于诊断问题。";

