"First time? See the setup, or use StikDebug or TrollStore instead" = "第一次使用？请查看设置流程，或改用 StikDebug、TrollStore";
"Hide" = "隐藏";
"It opens as soon as Android answers." = "Android 响应后会立即打开。";
"Make a folder named DeveloperTesting in DroidDeck's folder (Files > On My iPhone > DroidDeck) and put the APKs to test in it: an APK each, or a folder per app with its base and split APKs." = "在 DroidDeck 文件夹（文件 > 我的 iPhone > DroidDeck）中创建名为 DeveloperTesting 的文件夹，并放入要测试的 APK：每个应用一个 APK，或为每个应用创建包含基础与拆分 APK 的文件夹。";
