"serve-folder.py is in DroidDeck's repository, under tools. The folder's contents land at the top of Shared Storage, so serve the folder that holds what a game expects there." = "serve-folder.py 位于 DroidDeck 仓库的 tools 目录。文件夹内容会放到“共享存储”顶层，请共享游戏需要读取内容所在的文件夹。";
"Share Results" = "分享结果";
