"Start Android?" = "启动 Android？";
"Start Mass Test" = "开始批量测试";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Tap with three fingers to show the interface" = "三指轻点以显示界面";
"Tested by the upstream Husk team on an iPhone." = "已由上游 Husk 团队在 iPhone 上测试。";
"The end of the log from the last time the game started. Share it when reporting a problem." = "这是游戏上次启动时日志的末尾部分。报告问题时请一并分享。";
"The game and everything it saved here are deleted from DroidDeck." = "该游戏及其保存在这里的全部数据都将从 DroidDeck 删除。";
"The game stopped" = "游戏已停止";
"The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it." = "报告包含该次运行的完整日志，以及所用设备和构建版本。除非你主动分享，否则不会发送任何内容。";
"This APK has no 64-bit code DroidDeck can run, so it will probably not start." = "此 APK 不包含 DroidDeck 可运行的 64 位代码，因此很可能无法启动。";
"This iPhone" = "这台 iPhone";
"Tints buttons, switches and selected states throughout the app." = "用于应用内按钮、开关和选中状态。";
"View Release" = "查看发布页";
"Where it stands" = "当前进度";
"Your DroidDeck log helps the developer see what went wrong. Only moderators can read it." = "你的 DroidDeck 日志可帮助开发者判断问题原因，只有审核人员能够查看。";
"Your Name" = "你的名字";
"ATTEMPT LOG" = "尝试日志";
"Boots the guest as soon as DroidDeck opens, when JIT is available." = "JIT 可用时，在 DroidDeck 打开后立即启动 Android。";
"CPU" = "CPU";
"ctrl" = "ctrl";
"DROIDDECK" = "DROIDDECK";
"DroidDeck ships one original icon so it remains visually distinct from upstream Husk." = "DroidDeck 仅提供一款独立原创图标，以便与上游 Husk 清晰区分。";
"Geode" = "Geode";
"GPU" = "GPU";
"How each 64-bit library maps onto the iPhone: its relocations, the instructions DroidDeck rewrites, and anything the loader works around." = "显示每个 64 位库如何映射到 iPhone，包括重定位、DroidDeck 重写的指令，以及加载器采用的兼容处理。";
"Saving keeps Android exactly as it is, so the next start skips booting." = "保存后会保留 Android 当前状态，下次启动可跳过完整开机过程。";
"The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in DroidDeck's source." = "完整实施计划按顺序记录在 DroidDeck 源码的 docs/04-translation-layer.md 中。";
"What the game is called in DroidDeck. The game itself is not changed." = "仅修改游戏在 DroidDeck 中显示的名称，不会更改游戏本身。";
"This is Geode's Android launcher. On DroidDeck, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it." = "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 DroidDeck 中，Geode 会直接运行在 Geometry Dash 内：请在这里（或 Geometry Dash 设置的“模组”中）开启它，然后启动 Geometry Dash，通过主菜单中的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供 Geode 所需的库，请保留。";
"Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps DroidDeck cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores." = "完整 Android 以模拟方式运行，因此比转译层中的游戏更慢。它适合运行 DroidDeck 暂时无法直接运行的应用，例如 Termux 或应用商店。";
"Touch always works. A gamepad and a pointer are not wired through to Android yet." = "触控始终可用；游戏手柄和鼠标指针暂未接入 Android。";
"This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away." = "当前安装在后台只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往系统设置完成操作。";
"The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing." = "游戏启动时不会覆盖显示控制栏、手柄或性能信息。三指同时轻点可显示控制栏，再次轻点可隐藏；游玩时控制栏中的“隐藏”按钮作用相同。";
"Geode is the mod loader for Geometry Dash. With it on, DroidDeck downloads Geode for this version of the game, and mods are found and installed in the game itself, from Geode's button on the main menu. Applies the next time the game starts." = "Geode 是 Geometry Dash 的模组加载器。开启后，DroidDeck 会下载适用于当前游戏版本的 Geode；模组可在游戏主菜单的 Geode 按钮中查找并安装。下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Automatic offers the controller for games that cannot be played without one (Unreal Engine games), when no real controller is connected. Always offers it for any game that understands one. A paired controller is always used." = "“自动”会在未连接实体手柄时，为无法离开手柄操作的游戏（如 Unreal Engine 游戏）提供屏幕控制器；“始终”会为所有支持手柄的游戏显示它。已配对的实体手柄始终优先使用。";
"Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too." = "Android 原生代码会依赖只能由手机实际确认的处理器和内存特性，尤其是库代码能否在旁边数据可写的情况下运行。请先开启 JIT，否则会跳过内存检查；结果也会写入控制台。";
"Its data goes with it. Save Android afterwards or the change is lost on the next launch." = "其数据也会一并删除。请随后保存 Android，否则下次启动时此更改会丢失。";
"Star the repo if you like this sort of thing" = "如果喜欢，欢迎为项目点星";
"first boot takes 5–15 min" = "首次启动需要 5–15 分钟";
"%d min · first boot takes 5–15 min" = "已用 %d 分钟 · 首次启动需要 5–15 分钟";
"about %d seconds remaining" = "预计还需约 %d 秒";
"about %d minutes remaining" = "预计还需约 %d 分钟";
"What's New in DroidDeck %@" = "DroidDeck %@ 新功能";
"DroidDeck now follows your iPhone language, with a full Simplified Chinese interface." = "DroidDeck 现在会跟随 iPhone 语言，并提供完整的简体中文界面。";
"Simplified Chinese interface" = "简体中文界面";
"Home, Library, Store, Settings and the setup flows are now available in Simplified Chinese." = "首页、应用库、商店、设置及引导流程现已支持简体中文。";
"Follows your iPhone language" = "跟随 iPhone 语言";
"DroidDeck shows Simplified Chinese on a Chinese iPhone and keeps English as the fallback language." = "iPhone 使用中文时，DroidDeck 会显示简体中文；其他语言环境仍以英文作为回退。";
"Localized status and errors" = "状态与错误提示中文化";
"JIT guidance, downloads, imports, Google Play messages and common error prompts now appear in Chinese too." = "JIT 引导、下载、导入、Google Play 消息及常见错误提示现在也会显示中文。";
"Saved machine" = "已保存的虚拟机";
".apk, and split bundles as .apks, .xapk or .apkm. Share them to DroidDeck, open them from Files, or tap + in the Library." = ".apk，以及 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm 格式的拆分包。你可以将它们共享到 DroidDeck、从“文件”中打开，或点击“应用库”中的 +。";
"1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, DroidDeck downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again." = "1. 确保已安装并连接 **LocalDevVPN**，状态栏中应显示 VPN 图标。\n2. 即使数据不会离开你的 iPhone，也必须开启 Wi-Fi。\n3. 必须开启 **开发者模式**（设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式）。\n4. 首次使用时，DroidDeck 会下载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟，请等待完成。\n5. 仍然失败？关闭再开启 LocalDevVPN，然后重新配对。";
"Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, DroidDeck can show your library but cannot start Android or a game." = "Android 应用和游戏会在运行时编译，因此需要可写入后再执行的内存。iOS 仅在调试器附加到 App 时允许这样做。开启 JIT 会短暂附加调试器；没有 JIT，DroidDeck 可以显示应用库，但无法启动 Android 或游戏。";
"Close other apps and let the phone cool. Games run natively, but some do work on the CPU that a real Android phone does on hardware. Low Power Mode slows DroidDeck down too." = "关闭其他 App 并让手机降温。游戏会以原生方式运行，但某些原本由 Android 手机硬件完成的工作仍需由 CPU 处理。低电量模式也会降低 DroidDeck 的速度。";
"Download a newer DroidDeck build when one is published, then install it over the old one with the same sideloader. Your library, apps and saves are kept." = "发布新版 DroidDeck 后，下载新版本，并使用原来的侧载工具覆盖安装。你的应用库、App 和存档都会保留。";
"DroidDeck has no Google Play services, so “Sign in with Google” buttons can fail. Use email or another sign-in if the app offers one." = "DroidDeck 不包含 Google Play 服务，因此“使用 Google 登录”按钮可能会失败。如果 App 提供电子邮件或其他登录方式，请改用那些方式。";
"Each app keeps its data inside DroidDeck. On an app's page, **Back Up Saves** exports them and **Restore Saves** brings them back, including onto another iPhone." = "每个 App 的数据都保存在 DroidDeck 内。在 App 详情页中，**备份存档**可将数据导出，**恢复存档**可将其还原，也可以恢复到另一台 iPhone。";
"Imported apps and their data live in DroidDeck's folder. Remove games you no longer play from their page. The full Android system download is about 2 GB more and is only needed for Android itself." = "导入的 App 及其数据位于 DroidDeck 文件夹中。可在游戏详情页移除不再游玩的游戏。完整 Android 系统还需要下载约 2 GB，仅在使用 Android 系统时需要。";
"JIT lasts as long as DroidDeck is running. When iOS closes DroidDeck in the background, or you swipe it away, the next launch needs JIT again. With Pair on this iPhone or a pairing file it is one tap." = "JIT 仅在 DroidDeck 持续运行期间有效。如果 iOS 在后台关闭 DroidDeck，或你将它从后台划掉，下次启动时需要重新开启 JIT。使用“在此 iPhone 上配对”或配对文件时，只需轻点一次。";
"Most apps and games run directly on your iPhone, the way native apps do. The full Android system is a separate, slower option for anything that only runs inside real Android." = "大多数 App 和游戏会像原生 App 一样直接在 iPhone 上运行。完整 Android 系统是独立且较慢的选项，供只能在真实 Android 环境中运行的内容使用。";
"Open StikDebug on its own and check that it has your pairing file and that LocalDevVPN is connected. Update StikDebug to the latest release. DroidDeck sends StikDebug its script itself, so nothing needs setting up for DroidDeck inside StikDebug." = "单独打开 StikDebug，确认其中已有你的配对文件，并且 LocalDevVPN 已连接。请将 StikDebug 更新到最新版本。DroidDeck 会自行把脚本发送给 StikDebug，无需在 StikDebug 中额外配置 DroidDeck。";
"Open its page in the Library. DroidDeck says why it stopped:\n• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. DroidDeck does not get around these.\n• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has 32-bit code. Find an arm64 (arm64-v8a) version.\n• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services DroidDeck cannot provide.\n• **Uses something DroidDeck does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added." = "在应用库中打开它的详情页，DroidDeck 会说明停止原因：\n• **受保护的 App：** 它会检查是否运行在真实 Android 手机上，或使用了反作弊或 DRM；DroidDeck 不会绕过这些限制。\n• **CPU 代码类型不正确：** APK 只有 32 位代码，请寻找 arm64（arm64-v8a）版本。\n• **App 不完整或缺少游戏数据：** APK 还需要拆分文件或 OBB，请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。\n• **需要 Google：** App 需要 Google 账号或 DroidDeck 无法提供的 Play 服务。\n• **使用了 DroidDeck 尚不支持的功能：** 请共享报告，以便后续添加支持。";
"Open the app's page in your Library and tap **Share Report**. For DroidDeck's own log, go to Settings › About › **Open Console**. Turning on **Developer Info** there adds more detail." = "在应用库中打开 App 详情页并轻点 **共享报告**。若要查看 DroidDeck 自身日志，请前往“设置 › 关于 › **打开控制台**”。在那里开启 **开发者信息** 可显示更多细节。";
"Pairing files stop working when the iPhone's trust settings are reset, and sometimes after an iOS update. Make a new one, or pair on the iPhone itself if you are on iOS 27, then import it again in Settings › JIT." = "重置 iPhone 的信任设置后，配对文件会失效；有时 iOS 更新后也会失效。请创建新的配对文件；如果使用 iOS 27，也可以直接在 iPhone 上配对，然后在“设置 › JIT”中重新导入。";
"Repacks from sites like APKVISION often turn the app's code into their own library or add tamper checks, and these break more often. Try the original APK from the developer or from APKMirror." = "APKVISION 等网站的重打包版本经常会把 App 代码转换为自己的程序库，或加入防篡改检查，因此更容易出错。请尝试开发者提供的原版 APK，或从 APKMirror 获取。";
"Tap **Start pairing** in DroidDeck first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › DroidDeck. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." = "先在 DroidDeck 中轻点 **开始配对**，并在询问时允许访问 **本地网络**。如果之前选择了不允许，请前往“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › DroidDeck”开启权限。必须开启 Wi-Fi，并提前开启开发者模式；首次开启开发者模式会重启 iPhone。";
"The first launch of a big game prepares its code and data, and can take up to a minute. If it is still black after that, close it, open it once more and share the report if nothing changes." = "大型游戏首次启动时需要准备代码和数据，最长可能需要一分钟。如果之后仍是黑屏，请关闭并重新打开一次；若仍无变化，请共享报告。";
"The first start downloads the Android image and boots it from cold, which takes a few minutes. After that DroidDeck restores a saved machine, which is much faster." = "首次启动会下载 Android 映像并进行冷启动，需要几分钟。之后 DroidDeck 会恢复已保存的虚拟机，速度会快得多。";
"Turn on **Open Apps in Windows** in Settings. Apps then open in a window you can move, resize and minimise." = "在设置中开启 **在窗口中打开 App**。之后 App 会在可移动、调整大小和最小化的窗口中打开。";
"When DroidDeck opens again it shows what happened, with a report you can share. Usually the game ran out of memory or hit something DroidDeck does not support yet. Close other apps, and share the report if it keeps happening." = "再次打开 DroidDeck 时，它会说明发生了什么，并提供可共享的报告。通常是游戏内存不足，或遇到了 DroidDeck 尚不支持的功能。请关闭其他 App；如果问题反复出现，请共享报告。";
"Yes. Connect it to your iPhone in Bluetooth settings, and games that support controllers see it." = "可以。请在蓝牙设置中将手柄连接到 iPhone，支持手柄的游戏就能识别它。";
"You can browse and import apps, but nothing Android can run. Every game and app needs JIT." = "你可以浏览和导入 App，但无法运行任何 Android 内容。所有游戏和 App 都需要 JIT。";
"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall DroidDeck with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **打开后立即关闭：** 签名证书可能已过期。免费 Apple 账号的签名有效期为 7 天。请使用侧载工具重新签名或安装 DroidDeck；你的 App 和存档会保留。\n• **“不受信任的开发者”：** 前往“设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理”，信任你的证书。\n• **要求开启开发者模式：** 前往“设置 › 隐私与安全性”开启开发者模式。";
"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or DroidDeck inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **iOS 27 或更高版本：** 设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对，无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26：** 使用内置 StikJIT、在电脑上创建的配对文件以及 LocalDevVPN。\n• **较旧的 iOS，或在 LiveContainer 中运行 DroidDeck：** 使用 StikDebug App。\n• **通过 TrollStore 安装：** 使用 TrollStore，并开启其 URL Scheme 设置。\n• **使用 Dopamine 越狱：** 在越狱设置中为 App 开启 JIT。";

/* Dynamic interface, diagnostics and runtime messages */
" — content was: %@" = " — 内容为：%@";
" — server said: %@" = " — 服务器返回：%@";
" (and %d more)" = "（另有 %d 项）";
" %d of them use tricks the older loader could not handle; the native runtime handles those too, except for optional anti-tamper code, which it leaves out." = " 其中 %d 个使用了旧版加载器无法处理的技巧；原生运行时也能处理它们，但会排除可选的防篡改代码。";
" DroidDeck turns the screen the way the game asks for." = " DroidDeck 会按游戏要求旋转屏幕。";
" It is a landscape game: DroidDeck turns the screen for it." = " 这是横屏游戏，DroidDeck 会为它旋转屏幕。";
"%.0f fps" = "%.0f 帧/秒";
"%@ (web app)" = "%@（网页 App）";
"%@ Built-in StikJIT needs iOS 26, LocalDevVPN, and a pairing file, which DroidDeck can make itself on iOS 27." = "%@ 内置 StikJIT 需要 iOS 26、LocalDevVPN 和配对文件；在 iOS 27 上，DroidDeck 可以自行创建配对文件。";
"%@ closed the app on purpose (%@). Apps with anti-tamper or anti-cheat protection do this when they find they are not on a certified Android phone, which DroidDeck cannot pretend to be for them." = "%@ 主动关闭了 App（%@）。带有防篡改或反作弊保护的 App 在发现设备并非经过认证的 Android 手机时会这样做，而 DroidDeck 无法为它们伪装成此类设备。";
"%@ did not answer (HTTP %d)." = "%@ 未响应（HTTP %d）。";
"%@ has not saved anything yet." = "%@ 尚未保存任何内容。";
"%@ iPhones run 64-bit ARM (arm64) code. Look for an arm64 or universal build of this app." = "%@ iPhone 运行 64 位 ARM（arm64）代码。请寻找此 App 的 arm64 或通用版本。";
"%@ is compressed inside its bundle, which DroidDeck cannot unpack yet." = "%@ 在应用包内经过压缩，DroidDeck 暂时无法解包。";
"%@ is gone from Android." = "%@ 已从 Android 中移除。";
