"The game exited" = "游戏已退出";
"The game has ended." = "游戏已结束。";
"The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again." = "助手未能在 90 秒内附加。请确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接，然后重试。";
"The request for DroidDeck's JIT helper could not be encoded." = "无法编码发送给 DroidDeck JIT 助手的请求。";
"the request was cancelled" = "请求已取消";
"The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing." = "运行时无法启动它。报告会说明缺少哪个部分。";
"The server" = "服务器";
"The snapshot did not match the release (sha256 %@, expected %@)." = "快照与发行版本不一致（sha256 为 %@，预期为 %@）。";
"this %@" = "这台 %@";
"This app carries anti-tamper protection (%@). Such protection checks that it runs on a certified Android phone and closes the app otherwise, so it may not start in DroidDeck." = "此 App 带有防篡改保护（%@）。这类保护会检查它是否运行在经过认证的 Android 手机上，否则便会关闭 App，因此它可能无法在 DroidDeck 中启动。";
"This app does its main work in Linux programs it starts as processes of their own (here %@). Its own screens run in DroidDeck, but iOS does not let an app start other processes, so those programs, and the games or tools they run, can not start yet." = "此 App 的主要工作由它以独立进程启动的 Linux 程序完成（此处为 %@）。App 自身的界面可以在 DroidDeck 中运行，但 iOS 不允许 App 启动其他进程，因此这些程序及其运行的游戏或工具暂时无法启动。";
"This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from DroidDeck's store." = "此 App 以多个部分（拆分 APK）发布，但只导入了基础 APK，因此缺少库或资源。请导入完整的应用包（.apks、.xapk 或 .apkm），或从 DroidDeck 商店获取。";
"This app only works signed in to a Google account. It asked Android to pick one, and DroidDeck has no Google accounts to offer, so the app closed." = "此 App 只有在登录 Google 账号后才能使用。它要求 Android 选择账号，但 DroidDeck 没有可提供的 Google 账号，因此 App 已关闭。";
"This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than DroidDeck can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services." = "此 App 对 Google Play 服务（Google 登录、账号和设备检查）的依赖超出了 DroidDeck 能够提供的范围。仅使用 Google 库的 App 可以运行，但此 App 缺少真实服务便会停止。";
"This copy of DroidDeck doesn't have the PS4 layer." = "此 DroidDeck 版本不包含 PS4 层。";
"This file is not an app DroidDeck can read: %@. It may be damaged, only partly downloaded, or not an Android app at all." = "此文件不是 DroidDeck 可读取的 App：%@。文件可能已损坏、仅下载了一部分，或根本不是 Android App。";
"This file is not an app DroidDeck can read. It may be damaged, only partly downloaded, or not an Android app at all." = "此文件不是 DroidDeck 可读取的 App。文件可能已损坏、仅下载了一部分，或根本不是 Android App。";
"This game keeps most of its data in an expansion file (OBB) that the Play Store downloads separately from the app. DroidDeck installed the app itself but not that file, so the game cannot load." = "此游戏将大部分数据保存在 Play 商店与 App 分开下载的扩展文件（OBB）中。DroidDeck 安装了 App 本身，但没有安装该文件，因此游戏无法加载。";
"This iPhone only lets an app run translated code while a debugger enables JIT for it. Open DroidDeck through StikDebug, or tap Turn On JIT in DroidDeck, then start the app again." = "这台 iPhone 只有在调试器为 App 开启 JIT 时，才允许其运行转译后的代码。请通过 StikDebug 打开 DroidDeck，或在 DroidDeck 中轻点“开启 JIT”，然后重新启动 App。";
"thread-local storage" = "线程局部存储";
"Timed out %@." = "%@ 超时。";
"Tool" = "工具";
"TrollStore can turn JIT on for DroidDeck: it opens DroidDeck and enables it, with no computer. In TrollStore's Settings, URL Scheme must be on." = "TrollStore 可以为 DroidDeck 开启 JIT：它会打开 DroidDeck 并启用 JIT，无需电脑。必须在 TrollStore 设置中开启 URL Scheme。";
"TrollStore did not enable JIT. In TrollStore's Settings turn on URL Scheme, and make sure DroidDeck was installed through TrollStore (or is signed with get-task-allow)." = "TrollStore 未能开启 JIT。请在 TrollStore 设置中开启 URL Scheme，并确认 DroidDeck 是通过 TrollStore 安装的（或签名包含 get-task-allow）。";
"TrollStore was not found on this %@. It installs on iOS 14.0 to 17.0." = "未在这台 %@ 上找到 TrollStore。它可安装在 iOS 14.0 至 17.0 上。";
